# Rendered output. SVG is a scratch step on the way to a PNG and is never kept.
*.svg

# PNG is generated too, but examples/ is the gallery: those pictures are what a
# reader sees in the README without installing anything, so they are committed
# alongside their source. Everywhere else a PNG is build output.
*.png
!examples/*.png

# Backups written by the installer, if the default location is overridden into
# a checkout. A backup inside a directory that gets copied elsewhere is the
# specific mistake this repository documents.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.orig
*.rej

# AI assistant artefacts.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.ai-context/
.memsearch/
.opencode/

# Work notes about this repository — kept per checkout, not part of what ships.
kb/

# Python bytecode.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS and editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
